      "comment": "MAJOR SWING (8) was below best last time when sixth but three back was a Grade 6 winner in quick time at this track. Has the ability and expected to go close. POPULAR MONSTER (6) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing eighth (29.87) in a Grade 5 at this track. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings four times from seven attempts. In the mix. SUNSET BOY (2) was prominent early off a low draw but weakened and dropped out when 6th over 380m at this track in Grade 5 company. Solid record here at the distance winning two races. Worth following up. FEDERAL ARLO (7) cannot be left out after placing here at this trip last start.",
